---
import SiteLayout from './SiteLayout.astro';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
import { aboutPath, contributePath, homePath, searchPath, uiFor, type UiLang } from '../lib';
import { getSiteBuildData } from '@hejiu/build-tools';

interface Props {
  siteKey: string;
  lang: UiLang;
}
const { siteKey, lang } = Astro.props;
const context = uiFor(siteKey, lang);
const { site, labels, contracts, data } = context;
const pathName = aboutPath(lang);
const title = `${labels.about} · ${lang === 'zh' ? site.labelZh : site.labelEn} · ${lang === 'zh' ? '喝酒去' : 'Hejiu'}`;
const canonical = `https://${site.host}${pathName}`;
const active = site.main ? 'guide' : site.key === 'atlas' ? 'places' : '';
const published = data.pages.filter((page) => page.lang === lang && page.published).length;
const preview = data.pages.filter((page) => page.lang === lang && !page.published).length;
const allSites = contracts.sites.map((entry) => getSiteBuildData(entry.key));
const allPublished = allSites.flatMap((entry) => entry.pages).filter((page) => page.published);
const totalPublished = allPublished.length;
const zhPublished = allPublished.filter((page) => page.lang === 'zh').length;
const enPublished = allPublished.filter((page) => page.lang === 'en').length;
const entityCount = new Set(allPublished.map((page) => page.id)).size;
---
<SiteLayout
  siteKey={siteKey}
  lang={lang}
  title={title}
  description={labels.about}
  canonical={canonical}
  pagePath={pathName}
  active={active}
  pageType="about"
>
  <div class="shell narrow-page">
    <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href={homePath(lang)}>{labels.home}</a>
      <span class="breadcrumbs__sep">/</span>
      <span aria-current="page">{labels.about}</span>
    </nav>
    <header class="page-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">{labels.about}</p>
      <h1>{labels.about} 喝酒去</h1>
      <p>{lang === 'zh' ? '一个内容源仓、一个工程仓、四个站点，一套内容身份与资料规则。' : 'One content repository, one core repository and four sites, with one identity and evidence system.'}</p>
    </header>
    <div class="prose">
      {lang === 'zh' ? (
        <>
          <p>喝酒去帮助读者认识不同的酒、理解喝法、读一点酒文化，并发现可以了解和体验酒的地方。四个站点分别回答“这是什么”“怎么喝”“杯子之外有什么故事”和“去哪里”。</p>
          <p>截至最近一次构建，四个站共发布 <strong>{totalPublished}</strong> 个页面（中文 {zhPublished}、英文 {enPublished}），涉及 {entityCount} 个已发布实体。英文页是否公开以页面状态为准：只有复核通过且源文散列一致的译文才进入公开索引。旧站中无法独立成页的档案已停用，不再作为公开页面；其旧地址返回 404，原文只保留在内部迁移记录与备份中。</p>
          <h2>内容如何组织</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>一个内容源仓：world-alcohol-encyclopedia，下分 beverages、guide、culture、atlas 与共享 media。</li>
            <li>一个工程仓：site-alcohol-core，承载构建器、契约、UI 与品牌资产；四个站点仓只放应用。</li>
            <li>主站 hejiu.org 承载喝法、收藏、搜索与旧地址；识酒内容在 beverages.hejiu.org，文化与去处各自成站。</li>
            <li>每个对象使用语言无关的稳定 ID；中文与英文正文独立维护，英文必须绑定所依据的中文文件散列。</li>
            <li>关系、来源、权利与翻译状态都由真实校验器检查，不在构建时猜测。</li>
          </ul>
          <h2>本批次覆盖</h2>
          <p>本站已发布 {published} 个页面{preview > 0 ? `，另有 ${preview} 个待复核预览` : '，没有待复核预览'}。各类型的实时数量以首页与目录页的统计为准，不在正文里重复硬编码。</p>
          <h2>资料来源与限制</h2>
          <p>每个公开页面都至少有一个独立于旧站的来源；旧站正文不再作为公开内容直接复制。项目代码采用 MIT，内容采用 CC BY 4.0；第三方标准、商标、图片与引用文本不在该许可内。</p>
          <p>没有核实来源的断言不会被写成“已审核”，也不会为了填满页面而虚构品牌、营业信息、活动或译文。具体营业时间、票价与预约方式仍应以场所官方渠道为准。</p>
          <p>这是静态站点，不提供登录、购买、预约或跨设备同步。</p>
        </>
      ) : (
        <>
          <p>Hejiu helps readers understand drinks, learn how to enjoy them, read a little culture, and find real places to visit. The four sites answer “what is this?”, “how do I enjoy it?”, “what stories sit beyond the glass?”, and “where can I go?”.</p>
          <p>As of the latest build, the four sites publish <strong>{totalPublished}</strong> pages ({zhPublished} Chinese and {enPublished} English) covering {entityCount} published entities. Whether an English page is public depends on its status: only reviewed translations whose source hash still matches enter the public index. Legacy archive records that could not stand alone have been retired from publication; their old URLs now return 404, and their source text remains only in the internal migration ledger and backup.</p>
          <h2>How content is organised</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>One content repository: world-alcohol-encyclopedia, with beverages, guide, culture, atlas and shared media.</li>
            <li>One core repository: site-alcohol-core, carrying the builder, contracts, UI and brand assets; the four site repositories hold only apps.</li>
            <li>hejiu.org carries ways to drink, saved items, search and legacy addresses; drinks live at beverages.hejiu.org, with culture and places as their own sites.</li>
            <li>Every object has a language-independent stable ID. Chinese and English are maintained separately, and each English file records the hash of the Chinese source it translated.</li>
            <li>Relationships, sources, rights and translation status are checked by a real validator rather than guessed at build time.</li>
          </ul>
          <h2>What this edition covers</h2>
          <p>This site currently publishes {published} pages{preview > 0 ? `, with ${preview} previews pending review` : ' with no pending review previews'}. Live counts for every type are shown on the home and directory pages rather than hard-coded in prose.</p>
          <h2>Sources and limits</h2>
          <p>Every published page has at least one source independent of the old site; legacy text is no longer copied into public pages. Code is MIT and content is CC BY 4.0; third-party standards, trademarks, photographs and quoted texts are not covered by that licence.</p>
          <p>Claims without checked sources are not presented as reviewed, and we do not invent brands, opening information, events or translations to fill pages. Current opening hours, ticket prices and booking rules should be checked with the venue's official channels.</p>
          <p>This is a static site. It does not provide accounts, purchases, bookings or cross-device sync.</p>
        </>
      )}
    </div>
    <div class="saved-tools">
      <a class="button button--primary" href={searchPath(lang)}>{labels.search} <Icon name="arrow-right" size={18} /></a>
      <a class="button button--ghost" href={contributePath(lang)}>{labels.contribute}</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</SiteLayout>
